      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KODA MULWEE (1) is worth forgiving last start after finishing seventh (23.04) from Box 4 at Gosford over 388m. Has a strong record out of this box with six wins and three minor placings from 13 starts. Should be very hard to beat this time. EXTREME BLUE (8) was well supported last time and rocketed out of the boxes with a scorching early sectional, going on to clock 17.14 in a 5 length win at this track over 300m. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. One of the key runners again. CROSSED TOES (2) has mixed form recently, finishing sixth (22.83) in a Grade 3/4 at Gosford latest but did run well two back when in the frame. Expected to bounce back to best. MY JULIA (6) is always hard to beat when she races here at this trip.",
